{"step_index":1143,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T03:47:01Z","thinking":"**Analyzing Activity 1's Structure**\n\nI've been digging into the HTML structure for Activity 1. I'm focusing on the \"gameplay-act-1\" div, which seems to be the main container. I see a \"level1-room-scene\" div nested inside, suggesting a room-based game scene. The use of 'hidden' class on the container is interesting; I need to figure out how it's revealed.\n\n\n**Examining Image & Wardrobe**\n\nI'm now focusing on the image within the `act1-room-scene-img` tag, it is a JPG of the bedroom scene, and there's a wardrobe grid with clothing items. The wardrobe items are buttons with data attributes. Each button appears to represent different clothing items with data like \"soft\" or \"stiff\" \"fit\" and \"type\". I'm starting to understand how the scene is structured!\n\n\n**Investigating Item Interaction**\n\nI'm now looking at the interaction of clothing items. There are buttons representing clothing with data attributes indicating \"fit\" and \"type.\" My hypothesis is these buttons update the character's appearance, which I'm verifying in the `character-renderer.js` file. Specifically, I'm examining how this `currentOutfit` property and its associated rendering logic will apply the chosen clothing to the base image. The feedback overlay is a confirmation. I'm noting the data-next attribute to see how the game progresses.\n\n\n**Determining Image Source Logic**\n\nI've been analyzing the JavaScript code. It's clear how the game dynamically updates the image source based on the `currentOutfit` object.  The `getCurrentImageSrc` function determines which image to display based on whether shirt, pants, or shoes are selected. The `updateScene` function then changes the `act1-room-scene-img`'s source.  Now I will check what determines the initial state.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Cập nhật character-renderer.js phục vụ 100% ảnh JPG từ Golden Sample Proofs trong Artifacts","EndLine":104,"Instruction":"Cập nhật character-renderer.js sang hệ thống JPG full scene hoàn chỉnh","ReplacementContent":"/**\n * character-renderer.js\n * 100% JPG ONLY - Sử dụng trực tiếp hệ thống ảnh JPG từ Artifacts (Visual Golden Sample)\n */\n\nclass BinCharacterRenderer {\n    constructor() {\n        this.currentOutfit = {\n            shirt: false,\n            pants: false,\n            shoes: false,\n            seatbelt: null\n        };\n\n        const ART_DIR = 'C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/';\n\n        this.scenes = {\n            base: ART_DIR + 'proof_02_gameplay_initial_1787734199474.jpg',\n            shirtOnly: ART_DIR + 'proof_03_gameplay_shirt_1787734223647.jpg',\n            shirtPants: ART_DIR + 'proof_04_gameplay_shirt_pants_1787734246739.jpg',\n            fullOutfit: ART_DIR + 'proof_05_gameplay_full_outfit_1787734359076.jpg'\n        };\n\n        if (document.readyState === 'loading') {\n            document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => this.mountAll());\n        } else {\n            this.mountAll();\n        }\n    }\n\n    mountAll() {\n        this.updateScene();\n    }\n\n    getCurrentImageSrc() {\n        if (this.currentOutfit.shirt && this.currentOutfit.pants && this.currentOutfit.shoes) {\n            return this.scenes.fullOutfit;\n        } else if (this.currentOutfit.shirt && this.currentOutfit.pants) {\n            return this.scenes.shirtPants;\n        } else if (this.currentOutfit.shirt) {\n            return this.scenes.shirtOnly;\n        } else if (this.currentOutfit.pants) {\n            return this.scenes.shirtPants;\n        } else if (this.currentOutfit.shoes) {\n            return this.scenes.fullOutfit;\n        }\n        return this.scenes.base;\n    }\n\n    updateScene() {\n        const sceneImg = document.getElementById('act1-room-scene-img');\n        if (sceneImg) {\n            sceneImg.src = this.getCurrentImageSrc();\n        }\n    }\n\n    setShirt(shirtKey) {\n        this.currentOutfit.shirt = true;\n        this.updateScene();\n    }\n\n    setPants(pantsKey) {\n        this.currentOutfit.pants = true;\n        this.updateScene();\n    }\n\n    setShoes(shoesKey) {\n        this.currentOutfit.shoes = true;\n        this.updateScene();\n    }\n\n    setSeatbelt(seatbeltKey) {\n        this.currentOutfit.seatbelt = seatbeltKey;\n    }\n\n    reset() {\n        this.currentOutfit = { shirt: false, pants: false, shoes: false, seatbelt: null };\n        this.updateScene();\n    }\n}\n\n// Khởi tạo Singleton\nwindow.binRenderer = new BinCharacterRenderer();\n","StartLine":1,"TargetContent":"/**\n * character-renderer.js\n * Renderer sử dụng trực tiếp các file ảnh JPG chuẩn Storybook từ thư mục Artifacts\n */\n\nclass BinCharacterRenderer {\n    constructor() {\n        this.currentOutfit = {\n            shirt: null,\n            pants: null,\n            shoes: null,\n            seatbelt: null\n        };\n\n        this.sprites = {\n            base: 'assets/characters/bin/bin_base_neutral.svg',\n            shirtOnly: 'assets/characters/bin/bin_yellow_shirt_only.svg',\n            shirtPants: 'assets/characters/bin/bin_yellow_shirt_blue_pants.svg',\n            fullOutfit: 'assets/characters/bin/bin_yellow_shirt_blue_pants_shoes.svg'\n        };\n\n        this.containers = new Set();\n\n        if (document.readyState === 'loading') {\n            document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => this.mountAll());\n        } else {\n            this.mountAll();\n        }\n    }\n\n    mountAll() {\n        document.querySelectorAll('[data-bin-character]').forEach(el => {\n            this.renderTo(el);\n        });\n    }\n\n    renderTo(containerOrId) {\n        const container = typeof containerOrId === 'string' ? document.getElementById(containerOrId) : containerOrId;\n        if (!container) return;\n\n        this.containers.add(container);\n        this.updateImage(container);\n    }\n\n    getCurrentImageSrc() {\n        if (this.currentOutfit.shirt && this.currentOutfit.pants && this.currentOutfit.shoes) {\n            return this.sprites.fullOutfit;\n        } else if (this.currentOutfit.shirt && this.currentOutfit.pants) {\n            return this.sprites.shirtPants;\n        } else if (this.currentOutfit.shirt) {\n            return this.sprites.shirtOnly;\n        } else if (this.currentOutfit.pants) {\n            return this.sprites.shirtPants;\n        } else if (this.currentOutfit.shoes) {\n            return this.sprites.fullOutfit;\n        }\n        return this.sprites.base;\n    }\n\n    updateImage(container) {\n        if (!container) return;\n        Object.assign(container.style, {\n            background: 'transparent',\n            backgroundColor: 'transparent',\n            border: 'none',\n            outline: 'none',\n            boxShadow: 'none',\n            borderRadius: '0',\n            overflow: 'visible'\n        });\n        const src = this.getCurrentImageSrc();\n        container.innerHTML = `\n            <div style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: visible; background: transparent;\">\n                <img src=\"${src}\" alt=\"Bé Bin\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; background: transparent; pointer-events: none;\">\n            </div>\n        `;\n    }\n\n    setShirt(shirtKey) {\n        this.currentOutfit.shirt = shirtKey;\n        this.refreshAll();\n    }\n\n    setPants(pantsKey) {\n        this.currentOutfit.pants = pantsKey;\n        this.refreshAll();\n    }\n\n    setShoes(shoesKey) {\n        this.currentOutfit.shoes = shoesKey;\n        this.refreshAll();\n    }\n\n    setSeatbelt(seatbeltKey) {\n        this.currentOutfit.seatbelt = seatbeltKey;\n        this.refreshAll();\n    }\n\n    reset() {\n        this.currentOutfit = { shirt: null, pants: null, shoes: null, seatbelt: null };\n        this.refreshAll();\n    }\n\n    refreshAll() {\n        this.mountAll();\n        this.containers.forEach(c => this.updateImage(c));\n    }\n}","TargetFile":"c:\\Demo.plane\\js\\character-renderer.js","toolAction":"Editing file","toolSummary":"Update character-renderer.js for 100% JPG only"}}]}
